### GET request to check controller health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### GET request to get actuator health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Send POST request with json body
POST http://localhost:8080/api/policy/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyType": "Health Insurance",
  "premium": 1500.75,
  "coverageAmount": 500000.00,
  "startDate": "2026-09-05",
  "endDate": "2027-09-05",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### GET request to get policy by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/policy/3

### GET request for all policies
GET http://localhost:8080/api/policies

### POST request to update policy
POST http://localhost:8080/api/policy/update/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyType": "Travel Insurance",
  "premium": 4500.75,
  "coverageAmount": 1500000.00,
  "startDate": "2026-09-05",
  "endDate": "2027-09-05",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### DELETE request for policy
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/policy/2